{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skulls or Tails is a roguelike coinbuilder where coins are your actions. Each coin has two sides with different effects, and the outcome of each turn is determined by physics \u2014 by how the coins fall and land on the table. Coins act both as combat actions and as currency, merging physics-based gameplay, battle strategy, and resource management into one system. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/7cd091c06eaa8fff051971cd01b27203.poster.avif?t=1760892403\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/7cd091c06eaa8fff051971cd01b27203.webm?t=1760892403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/7cd091c06eaa8fff051971cd01b27203.mp4?t=1760892403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coins are your actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every coin has two sides, each with a distinct effect, creating constant choice and variability. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/c3e0285a3050914d936721884c9eebe3.poster.avif?t=1760892403\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/c3e0285a3050914d936721884c9eebe3.webm?t=1760892403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/c3e0285a3050914d936721884c9eebe3.mp4?t=1760892403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactile physics-driven play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins are physical objects on the table, colliding, stacking, and shaking for a more tangible gameplay feel.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/e029127e8b7549afe58d93d0e09e67aa.poster.avif?t=1760892403\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/e029127e8b7549afe58d93d0e09e67aa.webm?t=1760892403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/e029127e8b7549afe58d93d0e09e67aa.mp4?t=1760892403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy meets strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins serve both as combat tools and as currency, merging battle and resource management into a single system.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/9bfb49cfa2e32e376db622667e5ff39a.poster.avif?t=1760892403\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/9bfb49cfa2e32e376db622667e5ff39a.webm?t=1760892403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/9bfb49cfa2e32e376db622667e5ff39a.mp4?t=1760892403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bizarre look</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0410 dark blend of fantasy and tales that pulls you deeper into the game\u2019s atmosphere. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/1af4caf2314a1bdacbcc2b880d30fbe5.poster.avif?t=1760892403\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/1af4caf2314a1bdacbcc2b880d30fbe5.webm?t=1760892403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/1af4caf2314a1bdacbcc2b880d30fbe5.mp4?t=1760892403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/877a45f2d0aeecc54ce5fa9ea58a5b3c.webp?t=1760892403\" width=151 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Skulls or Tails to your wishlist and support our small team of developers bringing this dark tale to life!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039170?t=1760892403","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039170?t=1760892403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/7f2839db29b395f89fdbb6b35abd3e1e88700499/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760892403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/7f2839db29b395f89fdbb6b35abd3e1e88700499/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760892403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skulls or Tails is a roguelike coinbuilder where coins are your actions. Each coin has two sides with different effects, and the outcome of each turn is determined by physics \u2014 by how the coins fall and land on the table. Coins act both as combat actions and as currency, merging physics-based gameplay, battle strategy, and resource management into one system. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039170/extras/7cd0